sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Acquisition strategy
    participant E as AL engine
    participant J as Atomic state journal
    participant O as TRAIN annotation oracle
    participant T as Acquired-only trainer
    participant V as Paid validation evaluator
    E->>S: IDs, features, predictions, aggregate difficulty
    S-->>E: QueryBatch without truth labels
    E->>E: Validate IDs, version, uniqueness and budget
    E->>J: Commit prepared request ID and selected IDs
    E->>O: Annotate selected TRAIN IDs
    O->>O: Persist idempotent receipt and unique charge
    O-->>E: Acquired labels
    E->>J: Commit pool, acquired labels and training_pending
    E->>T: Fit cumulative acquired TRAIN examples
    T-->>E: Model, optimizer and RNG checkpoint
    E->>J: Commit checkpoint hash and evaluation_pending
    E->>V: Predict and measure paid validation split
    V-->>E: Support-aware metrics and class difficulty
    E->>J: Commit reports and ready phase
    Note over E,J: Resume pending phases; preserve paid annotations
